flowchart TD
A[Open product frame] --> B[Review overview]
B --> C{Input valid?}
C -- No --> D[Show inline guidance]
D --> C
C -- Yes --> E[Apply interface action]
E --> F{Content available?}
F -- Yes --> G[Show updated content and confirmation]
F -- No --> H[Show empty or recovery state]
H --> E
G --> I[Retain location and state]
Rationale: The flow covers the primary path, validation, unavailable content, recovery, confirmation, and continuity.
Quality gates: every branch has visible feedback; actions are reversible where practical; no hidden prerequisite; focus returns to the affected region.